msgstr "Sore (3 jam dan 30 menit, termasuk istirahat)"

#: src/running-the-course/course-structure.md
msgid ""
"The [Idiomatic Rust](../idiomatic/welcome.md) deep dive is a 2-day class on "
"Rust idioms and patterns."
msgstr ""
"Pendalaman [Idiomatic Rust](../idiomatic/welcome.md) adalah kelas 2 hari "
"tentang idiom dan pola Rust."

#: src/running-the-course/course-structure.md
msgid ""
"You should be familiar with the material in [Rust Fundamentals](../welcome-"
"day-1.md) before starting this course."
msgstr ""
"Anda sebaiknya sudah memahami materi [Rust Fundamentals](../welcome-day-1.md) "
"sebelum memulai kursus ini."

#: src/running-the-course/course-structure.md
msgid "Morning (13 hours and 55 minutes, including breaks)"
msgstr "Pagi (13 jam dan 55 menit, termasuk istirahat)"

#: src/running-the-course/course-structure.md src/idiomatic/welcome.md
