msgstr "1 jam dan 45 menit"

#: src/running-the-course/course-structure.md
msgid "Unsafe (Work in Progress)"
msgstr "Unsafe (Masih Dikerjakan)"

#: src/running-the-course/course-structure.md
msgid ""
"The [Unsafe](../unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md) deep dive is a two-day class on "
"the _unsafe_ Rust language. It covers the fundamentals of Rust's safety "
"guarantees, the motivation for `unsafe`, review process for `unsafe` code, "
"FFI basics, and building data structures that the borrow checker would "
"normally reject."
msgstr ""
"Pendalaman [Unsafe](../unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md) adalah kelas dua hari "
"tentang bagian _unsafe_ dari bahasa Rust. Materinya mencakup dasar jaminan "
"keamanan Rust, alasan penggunaan `unsafe`, proses review kode `unsafe`, dasar "
"FFI, dan pembuatan struktur data yang biasanya ditolak borrow checker."

#: src/running-the-course/course-structure.md
msgid "not found - {{%course outline Unsafe}}"
msgstr "not found - {{%course outline Unsafe}}"

