msgid "Format"
msgstr "Format"

#: src/running-the-course/course-structure.md
msgid ""
"The course is meant to be very interactive and we recommend letting the "
"questions drive the exploration of Rust!"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini dirancang sangat interaktif. Kami menyarankan agar pertanyaan "
"peserta menjadi pendorong eksplorasi Rust!"

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md
msgid "There are several useful keyboard shortcuts in mdBook:"
msgstr "Ada beberapa shortcut keyboard yang berguna dalam mdBook:"

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md
msgid "<kbd>Arrow-Left</kbd>: Navigate to the previous page."
msgstr "<kbd>Arrow-Left</kbd>: Buka halaman sebelumnya."

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md
msgid "<kbd>Arrow-Right</kbd>: Navigate to the next page."
msgstr "<kbd>Arrow-Right</kbd>: Buka halaman berikutnya."

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Enter</kbd>: Execute the code sample that has focus."
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Enter</kbd>: Jalankan contoh kode yang sedang mendapat "
"fokus."

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md
msgid "<kbd>s</kbd>: Activate the search bar."
msgstr "<kbd>s</kbd>: Aktifkan kolom pencarian."

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md
msgid ""
"Mention that these shortcuts are standard for `mdbook` and can be useful when "
"navigating any `mdbook`\\-generated site."
msgstr ""
"Sampaikan bahwa shortcut ini merupakan fitur standar `mdbook` dan dapat "
"membantu navigasi pada situs apa pun yang dihasilkan `mdbook`."

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md
msgid "You can demonstrate each shortcut live to the students."
msgstr "Anda dapat memperagakan setiap shortcut secara langsung kepada peserta."

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md
msgid ""
"The <kbd>s</kbd> key for search is particularly useful for quickly finding "
"topics that have been discussed earlier."
msgstr ""
"Tombol <kbd>s</kbd> untuk pencarian sangat berguna untuk segera menemukan "
"topik yang sudah dibahas."

#: src/running-the-course/keyboard-shortcuts.md
msgid ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Enter</kbd> will be super important for you since "
"you'll do a lot of live coding."
msgstr ""
"<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Enter</kbd> akan sangat berguna karena Anda akan "
"banyak melakukan live coding."

