#: src/cargo/rust-ecosystem.md
msgid ""
"It is also extensible with sub command plugins as well (such as [cargo clippy]"
"(https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-clippy))."
msgstr ""
"Fungsinya juga dapat diperluas melalui plugin subcommand, seperti [cargo "
"clippy](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-clippy)."

#: src/cargo/rust-ecosystem.md
msgid ""
"Read more from the [official Cargo Book](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/)"
msgstr ""
"Baca lebih lanjut dalam [Cargo Book resmi](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/)"

#: src/cargo/code-samples.md
msgid "Code Samples in This Training"
msgstr "Contoh Kode dalam Pelatihan Ini"

#: src/cargo/code-samples.md
msgid ""
"For this training, we will mostly explore the Rust language through examples "
"which can be executed through your browser. This makes the setup much easier "
"and ensures a consistent experience for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Dalam pelatihan ini, kita terutama mempelajari Rust melalui contoh yang dapat "
"dijalankan di browser. Ini sangat mempermudah persiapan dan memastikan "
"pengalaman yang konsisten bagi semua peserta."

#: src/cargo/code-samples.md
msgid ""
"Installing Cargo is still encouraged: it will make it easier for you to do "
"the exercises. On the last day, we will do a larger exercise that shows you "
"how to work with dependencies and for that you need Cargo."
msgstr ""
"Anda tetap dianjurkan memasang Cargo karena akan mempermudah pengerjaan "
"latihan. Pada hari terakhir, kita akan mengerjakan latihan lebih besar yang "
"memperlihatkan cara menggunakan dependency. Untuk itu, Anda membutuhkan Cargo."

