#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid ""
"Rust is a new programming language that had its [1.0 release in 2015](https://"
"blog.rust-lang.org/2015/05/15/Rust-1.0.html):"
msgstr ""
"Rust adalah bahasa pemrograman baru yang [merilis versi 1.0 pada 2015]"
"(https://blog.rust-lang.org/2015/05/15/Rust-1.0.html):"

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "Rust is a statically compiled language in a similar role as C++"
msgstr ""
"Rust adalah bahasa yang dikompilasi secara statis dan memiliki peran serupa "
"dengan C++"

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "`rustc` uses LLVM as its backend."
msgstr "`rustc` menggunakan LLVM sebagai backend."

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid ""
"Rust supports many [platforms and architectures](https://doc.rust-lang.org/"
"nightly/rustc/platform-support.html):"
msgstr ""
"Rust mendukung banyak [platform dan arsitektur](https://doc.rust-lang.org/"
"nightly/rustc/platform-support.html):"

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "x86, ARM, WebAssembly, ..."
msgstr "x86, ARM, WebAssembly, ..."

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "Linux, Mac, Windows, ..."
msgstr "Linux, Mac, Windows, ..."

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "Rust is used for a wide range of devices:"
msgstr "Rust digunakan pada beragam perangkat:"

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "firmware and boot loaders,"
msgstr "firmware dan boot loader,"

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "smart displays,"
msgstr "smart display,"

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "mobile phones,"
msgstr "ponsel,"

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "desktops,"
msgstr "komputer desktop,"

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "servers."
msgstr "server."

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "Rust fits in the same area as C++:"
msgstr "Rust berada di ranah yang sama dengan C++:"

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "High flexibility."
msgstr "Fleksibilitas tinggi."

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "High level of control."
msgstr "Tingkat kendali yang tinggi."

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "Can be scaled down to very constrained devices such as microcontrollers."
msgstr ""
"Dapat disesuaikan untuk perangkat yang sumber dayanya sangat terbatas, "
"seperti microcontroller."

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "Has no runtime or garbage collection."
msgstr "Tidak memiliki runtime atau garbage collection."

#: src/hello-world/what-is-rust.md
msgid "Focuses on reliability and safety without sacrificing performance."
msgstr "Berfokus pada keandalan dan keamanan tanpa mengorbankan performa."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "Some unique selling points of Rust:"
msgstr "Beberapa keunggulan khas Rust:"

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid ""
"_Compile time memory safety_ - whole classes of memory bugs are prevented at "
"compile time"
msgstr ""
"_Memory safety saat compile time_ - seluruh kategori bug memori dicegah saat "
"compile time"

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "No uninitialized variables."
msgstr "Tidak ada variabel yang belum diinisialisasi."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "No double-frees."
msgstr "Tidak ada double-free."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "No use-after-free."
msgstr "Tidak ada use-after-free."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "No `NULL` pointers."
msgstr "Tidak ada pointer `NULL`."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "No forgotten locked mutexes."
msgstr "Tidak ada mutex terkunci yang terlupakan."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "No data races between threads."
msgstr "Tidak ada data race antarthread."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "No iterator invalidation."
msgstr "Tidak ada iterator invalidation."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid ""
"_No undefined runtime behavior_ - what a Rust statement does is never left "
"unspecified"
msgstr ""
"_Tidak ada undefined behavior saat runtime_ - perilaku suatu statement Rust "
"tidak pernah dibiarkan tanpa ketentuan"

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "Array access is bounds checked."
msgstr "Akses array diperiksa terhadap batasnya."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "Integer overflow is defined (panic or wrap-around)."
msgstr "Perilaku integer overflow ditentukan: panic atau wrap-around."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid ""
"_Modern language features_ - as expressive and ergonomic as higher-level "
"languages"
msgstr ""
"_Fitur bahasa modern_ - sama ekspresif dan ergonomisnya dengan bahasa tingkat "
"tinggi"

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "Enums and pattern matching."
msgstr "Enum dan pattern matching."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "Generics."
msgstr "Generics."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "No overhead FFI."
msgstr "FFI tanpa overhead."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "Zero-cost abstractions."
msgstr "Zero-cost abstraction."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "Great compiler errors."
msgstr "Pesan error compiler yang sangat baik."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "Built-in dependency manager."
msgstr "Dependency manager bawaan."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "Built-in support for testing."
msgstr "Dukungan testing bawaan."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid "Excellent Language Server Protocol support."
msgstr "Dukungan Language Server Protocol yang sangat baik."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid ""
"Do not spend much time here. All of these points will be covered in more "
"depth later."
msgstr ""
"Jangan menghabiskan banyak waktu di sini. Semua hal ini akan dibahas lebih "
"mendalam nanti."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid ""
"Make sure to ask the class which languages they have experience with. "
"Depending on the answer you can highlight different features of Rust:"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan Anda menanyakan bahasa pemrograman yang sudah dikuasai peserta. "
"Berdasarkan jawabannya, Anda dapat menyoroti fitur Rust yang berbeda:"

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid ""
"Experience with C or C++: Rust eliminates a whole class of _runtime errors_ "
"via the borrow checker. You get performance like in C and C++, but you don't "
"have the memory unsafety issues. In addition, you get a modern language with "
"constructs like pattern matching and built-in dependency management."
msgstr ""
"Pengalaman dengan C atau C++: Rust menghilangkan seluruh kategori _runtime "
"error_ melalui borrow checker. Anda memperoleh performa seperti C dan C++, "
"tanpa masalah ketidakamanan memori. Selain itu, Anda mendapatkan bahasa "
"modern dengan konstruksi seperti pattern matching dan pengelolaan dependency "
"bawaan."

#: src/hello-world/benefits.md
msgid ""
"Experience with Java, Go, Python, JavaScript...: You get the same memory "
"safety as in those languages, plus a similar high-level language feeling. In "
"addition you get fast and predictable performance like C and C++ (no garbage "
"collector) as well as access to low-level hardware (should you need it)."
msgstr ""
"Pengalaman dengan Java, Go, Python, JavaScript...: Anda memperoleh memory "
"safety yang sama seperti dalam bahasa-bahasa tersebut, serta pengalaman "
"serupa bahasa tingkat tinggi. Selain itu, Anda mendapatkan performa cepat dan "
"dapat diprediksi seperti C dan C++ (tanpa garbage collector), serta akses ke "
"hardware tingkat rendah jika diperlukan."

#: src/hello-world/playground.md
msgid ""
"The [Rust Playground](https://play.rust-lang.org/) provides an easy way to "
"run short Rust programs, and is the basis for the examples and exercises in "
"this course. Try running the \"hello-world\" program it starts with. It comes "
"with a few handy features:"
msgstr ""
"[Rust Playground](https://play.rust-lang.org/) memudahkan Anda menjalankan "
"program Rust pendek dan menjadi dasar contoh serta latihan dalam kursus ini. "
"Coba jalankan program “hello-world” yang tersedia saat pertama dibuka. "
"Playground memiliki beberapa fitur praktis:"

#: src/hello-world/playground.md
msgid ""
"Under \"Tools\", use the `rustfmt` option to format your code in the "
"\"standard\" way."
msgstr ""
"Di bagian “Tools”, gunakan opsi `rustfmt` untuk memformat kode dengan cara "
"“standar”."

#: src/hello-world/playground.md
msgid ""
"Rust has two main \"profiles\" for generating code: Debug (extra runtime "
"checks, less optimization) and Release (fewer runtime checks, lots of "
"optimization). These are accessible under \"Debug\" at the top."
msgstr ""
"Rust memiliki dua “profile” utama untuk menghasilkan kode: Debug (pemeriksaan "
"runtime tambahan, optimasi lebih sedikit) dan Release (pemeriksaan runtime "
"lebih sedikit, banyak optimasi). Keduanya dapat diakses melalui “Debug” di "
"bagian atas."

#: src/hello-world/playground.md
msgid ""
"If you're interested, use \"ASM\" under \"...\" to see the generated assembly "
"code."
msgstr ""
"Jika tertarik, gunakan “ASM” di bawah “...” untuk melihat kode assembly yang "
"dihasilkan."

#: src/hello-world/playground.md
msgid ""
"As students head into the break, encourage them to open up the playground and "
"experiment a little. Encourage them to keep the tab open and try things out "
"during the rest of the course. This is particularly helpful for advanced "
"students who want to know more about Rust's optimizations or generated "
"assembly."
msgstr ""
"Saat peserta memasuki waktu istirahat, ajak mereka membuka playground dan "
"sedikit bereksperimen. Dorong mereka membiarkan tab tetap terbuka dan mencoba "
"berbagai hal selama sisa kursus. Ini sangat membantu peserta tingkat lanjut "
"yang ingin mengetahui lebih jauh tentang optimasi Rust atau assembly yang "
"dihasilkan."

