"The `Box` type here is a smart pointer, and will be covered in detail later "
"in the course. An expression can be \"boxed\" with `Box::new` as seen in the "
"tests. To evaluate a boxed expression, use the deref operator (`*`) to "
"\"unbox\" it: `eval(*boxed_expr)`."
msgstr ""
"Tipe `Box` di sini merupakan smart pointer dan akan dibahas terperinci nanti. "
"Ekspresi dapat “dibungkus” menggunakan `Box::new`, seperti terlihat pada "
"test. Untuk mengevaluasi ekspresi yang dibungkus, gunakan operator deref "
"(`*`) untuk “membukanya”: `eval(*boxed_expr)`."

