#: src/closures/traits.md
msgid ""
"An `Fn` (e.g. `add_suffix`) neither consumes nor mutates captured values. It "
"can be called needing only a shared reference to the closure, which means the "
"closure can be executed repeatedly and even concurrently."
msgstr ""
"`Fn`, misalnya `add_suffix`, tidak mengonsumsi atau mengubah nilai yang "
"ditangkap. Pemanggilannya hanya memerlukan shared reference ke closure, "
"sehingga closure dapat dijalankan berulang kali, bahkan secara concurrent."

#: src/closures/traits.md
msgid ""
"An `FnMut` (e.g. `accumulate`) might mutate captured values. The closure "
"object is accessed via exclusive reference, so it can be called repeatedly "
"but not concurrently."
msgstr ""
"`FnMut`, misalnya `accumulate`, dapat mengubah nilai yang ditangkap. Objek "
"closure diakses melalui exclusive reference, sehingga dapat dipanggil "
"berulang kali, tetapi tidak secara concurrent."

#: src/closures/traits.md
msgid ""
"If you have an `FnOnce` (e.g. `take_and_reverse`), you may only call it once. "
"Doing so consumes the closure and any values captured by move."
msgstr ""
"Jika memiliki `FnOnce`, misalnya `take_and_reverse`, Anda hanya dapat "
"memanggilnya sekali. Pemanggilan ini mengonsumsi closure dan semua nilai yang "
"ditangkap melalui move."

#: src/closures/traits.md
msgid ""
"`FnMut` is a subtype of `FnOnce`. `Fn` is a subtype of `FnMut` and `FnOnce`. "
"I.e. you can use an `FnMut` wherever an `FnOnce` is called for, and you can "
"use an `Fn` wherever an `FnMut` or `FnOnce` is called for."
msgstr ""
"`FnMut` merupakan subtype dari `FnOnce`. `Fn` merupakan subtype dari `FnMut` "
"dan `FnOnce`. Artinya, `FnMut` dapat digunakan ketika `FnOnce` diperlukan, "
"dan `Fn` dapat digunakan ketika `FnMut` atau `FnOnce` diperlukan."

#: src/closures/traits.md
msgid ""
"When you define a function that takes a closure, you should take `FnOnce` if "
"you can (i.e. you call it once), or `FnMut` else, and last `Fn`. This allows "
"the most flexibility for the caller."
msgstr ""
"Saat mendefinisikan fungsi yang menerima closure, sebaiknya terima `FnOnce` "
"jika memungkinkan, yaitu jika closure dipanggil sekali. Jika tidak, gunakan "
"`FnMut`, lalu `Fn` sebagai pilihan terakhir. Ini memberikan fleksibilitas "
"terbesar bagi caller."

#: src/closures/traits.md
msgid ""
"In contrast, when you have a closure, the most flexible you can have is `Fn` "
"(which can be passed to a consumer of any of the three closure traits), then "
"`FnMut`, and lastly `FnOnce`."
msgstr ""
"Sebaliknya, ketika Anda memiliki closure, bentuk paling fleksibel adalah "
"`Fn`, yang dapat diteruskan ke penerima salah satu dari ketiga trait closure, "
"kemudian `FnMut`, dan terakhir `FnOnce`."

#: src/closures/traits.md
msgid ""
"The compiler also infers `Copy` (e.g. for `add_suffix`) and `Clone` (e.g. "
"`take_and_reverse`), depending on what the closure captures. Function "
"pointers (references to `fn` items) implement `Copy` and `Fn`."
msgstr ""
"Compiler juga menyimpulkan `Copy`, misalnya untuk `add_suffix`, dan `Clone`, "
"misalnya untuk `take_and_reverse`, sesuai nilai yang ditangkap closure. "
"Function pointer, yaitu reference ke item `fn`, mengimplementasikan `Copy` "
"dan `Fn`."

