#: src/closures/solution.md
msgid ""
"**Storing Closures:** To store a closure in a struct, we use a generic type "
"parameter (here `P`). This is because every closure in Rust has a unique, "
"anonymous type generated by the compiler."
msgstr ""
"**Menyimpan Closure:** Untuk menyimpan closure dalam struct, kita menggunakan "
"parameter tipe generic, yaitu `P` di sini. Sebab, setiap closure dalam Rust "
"memiliki tipe anonim unik yang dihasilkan compiler."

#: src/closures/solution.md
msgid ""
"**`Fn` Trait Bound:** The bound `P: Fn(u8, &str) -> bool` tells the compiler "
"that `P` can be called as a function with the specified arguments and return "
"type. We use `Fn` (instead of `FnMut` or `FnOnce`) because `log` takes "
"`&self`, so we can only access the predicate immutably."
msgstr ""
"**Trait Bound `Fn`:** Bound `P: Fn(u8, &str) -> bool` memberi tahu compiler "
"bahwa `P` dapat dipanggil sebagai fungsi dengan argumen dan tipe nilai "
"kembalian tersebut. Kita menggunakan `Fn`, bukan `FnMut` atau `FnOnce`, "
"karena `log` menerima `&self`, sehingga predicate hanya dapat diakses secara "
"immutable."

#: src/closures/solution.md
msgid ""
"**Calling fields:** We invoke the closure using `(self.predicate)(...)`. The "
"parentheses around `self.predicate` are necessary to disambiguate between "
"calling a method named `predicate` and calling the field itself."
msgstr ""
"**Memanggil Field:** Kita memanggil closure menggunakan `(self.predicate)"
"(...)`. Tanda kurung pada `self.predicate` diperlukan untuk membedakan "
"pemanggilan method bernama `predicate` dari pemanggilan field itu sendiri."

#: src/closures/solution.md
msgid ""
"Discuss why `Fn` is required. If we used `FnMut`, `log` would need to take "
"`&mut self`, which conflicts with the `Logger` trait signature. If we used "
"`FnOnce`, we could only log a single message!"
msgstr ""
"Bahas mengapa `Fn` diperlukan. Jika menggunakan `FnMut`, `log` harus menerima "
"`&mut self`, yang bertentangan dengan signature trait `Logger`. Jika "
"menggunakan `FnOnce`, kita hanya dapat mencatat satu pesan!"

#: src/closures/solution.md
msgid ""
"The `impl` block for `new` also includes the bounds. While technically not "
"strictly required for the struct definition itself (bounds can be placed only "
"on `impl` blocks that use them), putting them on `new` helps type inference."
msgstr ""
"Block `impl` untuk `new` juga menyertakan bound. Walaupun secara teknis tidak "
"diwajibkan pada definisi struct itu sendiri—bound dapat diletakkan hanya pada "
"block `impl` yang memerlukannya—menyertakannya pada `new` membantu type "
"inference."

