#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"`String` implements [`Deref<Target = str>`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/"
"string/struct.String.html#deref-methods-str), which means that you can call "
"all `str` methods on a `String`."
msgstr ""
"`String` mengimplementasikan [`Deref<Target = str>`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/std/string/struct.String.html#deref-methods-str), sehingga semua "
"method `str` dapat dipanggil pada `String`."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"`String::new` returns a new empty string, use `String::with_capacity` when "
"you know how much data you want to push to the string."
msgstr ""
"`String::new` mengembalikan string kosong baru. Gunakan "
"`String::with_capacity` jika Anda mengetahui jumlah data yang akan "
"ditambahkan ke string."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"`String::len` returns the size of the `String` in bytes (which can be "
"different from its length in characters)."
msgstr ""
"`String::len` mengembalikan ukuran `String` dalam byte, yang dapat berbeda "
"dari panjangnya dalam karakter."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"`String::chars` returns an iterator over the actual characters. Note that a "
"`char` can be different from what a human will consider a \"character\" due "
"to [grapheme clusters](https://docs.rs/unicode-segmentation/latest/"
"unicode_segmentation/struct.Graphemes.html)."
msgstr ""
"`String::chars` mengembalikan iterator atas karakter yang sebenarnya. "
"Perhatikan bahwa `char` dapat berbeda dari apa yang dianggap manusia sebagai "
"“karakter” karena adanya [grapheme cluster](https://docs.rs/unicode-"
"segmentation/latest/unicode_segmentation/struct.Graphemes.html)."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"When people refer to strings they could either be talking about `&str` or "
"`String`."
msgstr ""
"Ketika orang menyebut string, yang dimaksud dapat berupa `&str` atau `String`."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"When a type implements `Deref<Target = T>`, the compiler will let you "
"transparently call methods from `T`."
msgstr ""
"Ketika suatu tipe mengimplementasikan `Deref<Target = T>`, compiler "
"memungkinkan pemanggilan method dari `T` secara transparan."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"We haven't discussed the `Deref` trait yet, so at this point this mostly "
"explains the structure of the sidebar in the documentation."
msgstr ""
"Kita belum membahas trait `Deref`, sehingga pada tahap ini penjelasannya "
"terutama membantu memahami struktur sidebar dokumentasi."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"`String` implements `Deref<Target = str>` which transparently gives it access "
"to `str`'s methods."
msgstr ""
"`String` mengimplementasikan `Deref<Target = str>`, yang secara transparan "
"memberikan akses ke method `str`."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid "Write and compare `let s3 = s1.deref();` and `let s3 = &*s1;`."
msgstr "Tulis dan bandingkan `let s3 = s1.deref();` dengan `let s3 = &*s1;`."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"`String` is implemented as a wrapper around a vector of bytes, many of the "
"operations you see supported on vectors are also supported on `String`, but "
"with some extra guarantees."
msgstr ""
"`String` diimplementasikan sebagai wrapper atas vector byte. Banyak operasi "
"yang didukung vector juga didukung `String`, dengan beberapa jaminan tambahan."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid "Compare the different ways to index a `String`:"
msgstr "Bandingkan berbagai cara mengindeks `String`:"

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"To a character by using `s3.chars().nth(i).unwrap()` where `i` is in-bound, "
"out-of-bounds."
msgstr ""
"Mengakses karakter menggunakan `s3.chars().nth(i).unwrap()` ketika `i` berada "
"di dalam dan di luar batas."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"To a substring by using `s3[0..4]`, where that slice is on character "
"boundaries or not."
msgstr ""
"Mengakses substring menggunakan `s3[0..4]` ketika batas slice sejajar dan "
"tidak sejajar dengan batas karakter."

#: src/std-types/string.md
msgid ""
"Many types can be converted to a string with the [`to_string`](https://"
"doc.rust-lang.org/std/string/trait.ToString.html#tymethod.to_string) method. "
"This trait is automatically implemented for all types that implement "
"`Display`, so anything that can be formatted can also be converted to a "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Banyak tipe dapat dikonversi menjadi string menggunakan method [`to_string`]"
"(https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/string/"
"trait.ToString.html#tymethod.to_string). Trait ini otomatis diimplementasikan "
"untuk semua tipe yang mengimplementasikan `Display`, sehingga apa pun yang "
"dapat diformat juga dapat dikonversi menjadi string."

