#: src/modules/filesystem.md
msgid ""
"This is useful, for example, if you would like to place tests for a module in "
"a file named `some_module_test.rs`, similar to the convention in Go."
msgstr ""
"Ini berguna, misalnya, jika Anda ingin menempatkan test module dalam berkas "
"bernama `some_module_test.rs`, serupa dengan konvensi Go."

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid "Modules are a privacy boundary:"
msgstr "Module merupakan batas privacy:"

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid "Module items are private by default (hides implementation details)."
msgstr ""
"Item module bersifat private secara default untuk menyembunyikan detail "
"implementasi."

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid "Parent and sibling items are always visible."
msgstr "Item induk dan saudara selalu terlihat."

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid ""
"In other words, if an item is visible in module `foo`, it's visible in all "
"the descendants of `foo`."
msgstr ""
"Dengan kata lain, jika item terlihat dalam module `foo`, item itu juga "
"terlihat dalam semua turunan `foo`."

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid "\"outer::private\""
msgstr "\"outer::private\""

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid "\"outer::public\""
msgstr "\"outer::public\""

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid "\"outer::inner::private\""
msgstr "\"outer::inner::private\""

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid "\"outer::inner::public\""
msgstr "\"outer::inner::public\""

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid "Use the `pub` keyword to make modules public."
msgstr "Gunakan keyword `pub` untuk menjadikan module public."

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid ""
"Additionally, there are advanced `pub(...)` specifiers to restrict the scope "
"of public visibility."
msgstr ""
"Selain itu, tersedia specifier lanjutan `pub(...)` untuk membatasi cakupan "
"visibility public."

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid ""
"See the [Rust Reference](https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/visibility-and-"
"privacy.html#pubin-path-pubcrate-pubsuper-and-pubself)."
msgstr ""
"Lihat [Rust Reference](https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/visibility-and-"
"privacy.html#pubin-path-pubcrate-pubsuper-and-pubself)."

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid "Configuring `pub(crate)` visibility is a common pattern."
msgstr "Pengaturan visibility `pub(crate)` merupakan pola yang umum."

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid "Less commonly, you can give visibility to a specific path."
msgstr ""
"Walaupun lebih jarang, Anda dapat memberikan visibility ke path tertentu."

#: src/modules/visibility.md
msgid ""
"In any case, visibility must be granted to an ancestor module (and all of its "
"descendants)."
msgstr ""
"Dalam semua kasus, visibility harus diberikan kepada module leluhur beserta "
"semua turunannya."

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid "Visibility and Encapsulation"
msgstr "Visibility dan Encapsulation"

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid ""
"Like with items in a module, struct fields are also private by default. "
"Private fields are likewise visible within the rest of the module (including "
"child modules). This allows us to encapsulate implementation details of "
"struct, controlling what data and functionality is visible externally."
msgstr ""
"Seperti item dalam module, field struct juga bersifat private secara default. "
"Field private tetap terlihat di bagian lain module, termasuk module anak. "
"Dengan demikian, kita dapat melakukan encapsulation terhadap detail "
"implementasi struct dan mengatur data serta fungsionalitas yang terlihat dari "
"luar."

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid "\"Is {} big? {}\""
msgstr "\"Is {} big? {}\""

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid "\"foo.val = {}\""
msgstr "\"foo.val = {}\""

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid "// let foo = Foo { val: 42, is_big: true };\n"
msgstr "// let foo = Foo { val: 42, is_big: true };\n"

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid "// println!(\"Is {} big? {}\", foo.val, foo.is_big);\n"
msgstr "// println!(\"Is {} big? {}\", foo.val, foo.is_big);\n"

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid ""
"This slide demonstrates how privacy in structs is module-based. Students "
"coming from object-oriented languages may be used to types being the "
"encapsulation boundary, so this demonstrates how Rust behaves differently "
"while showing how we can still achieve encapsulation."
msgstr ""
"Slide ini menunjukkan bahwa privacy struct berbasis module. Peserta yang "
"terbiasa dengan bahasa object-oriented mungkin menganggap tipe sebagai batas "
"encapsulation. Contoh ini menunjukkan perbedaan perilaku Rust sekaligus cara "
"tetap mencapai encapsulation."

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid ""
"Note how the `is_big` field is fully controlled by `Foo`, allowing `Foo` to "
"control how it's initialized and enforce any invariants it needs to (e.g. "
"that `is_big` is only `true` if `val > 100`)."
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa field `is_big` sepenuhnya dikendalikan `Foo`, sehingga `Foo` "
"dapat mengatur inisialisasi dan menegakkan invariant yang diperlukan. "
"Misalnya, `is_big` hanya bernilai `true` jika `val > 100`."

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid ""
"Point out how helper functions can be defined in the same module (including "
"child modules) in order to get access to the type's private fields/methods."
msgstr ""
"Tunjukkan bahwa fungsi bantu dapat didefinisikan dalam module yang sama, "
"termasuk module anak, untuk mengakses field/method private suatu tipe."

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid ""
"The first commented out line demonstrates that you cannot initialize a struct "
"with private fields. The second one demonstrates that you also can't directly "
"access private fields."
msgstr ""
"Baris komentar pertama menunjukkan bahwa Anda tidak dapat menginisialisasi "
"struct dengan field private. Baris kedua menunjukkan bahwa field private juga "
"tidak dapat diakses langsung."

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid ""
"Enums do not support privacy: Variants and data within those variants is "
"always public."
msgstr ""
"Enum tidak mendukung privacy: variant dan data di dalamnya selalu public."

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid ""
"If students want more information about privacy (or lack thereof) in enums, "
"you can bring up `#[doc_hidden]` and `#[non_exhaustive]` and show how they're "
"used to limit what can be done with an enum."
msgstr ""
"Jika peserta ingin mengetahui lebih lanjut tentang privacy atau ketiadaannya "
"pada enum, tunjukkan `#[doc_hidden]` dan `#[non_exhaustive]`, serta cara "
"keduanya membatasi penggunaan enum."

#: src/modules/encapsulation.md
msgid ""
"Module privacy still applies when there are `impl` blocks in other modules "
"[(example in the playground)](https://play.rust-lang.org/?"
"version=stable&mode=debug&edition=2024&gist=3e61f43c88de12bcdf69c1d6df9ab3da)."
msgstr ""
"Privacy module tetap berlaku ketika block `impl` berada dalam module lain "
"[(contoh di playground)](https://play.rust-lang.org/?"
"version=stable&mode=debug&edition=2024&gist=3e61f43c88de12bcdf69c1d6df9ab3da)."

