#: src/testing/unit-tests.md
msgid ""
"Rust and Cargo come with a simple unit test framework. Tests are marked with "
"`#[test]`. Unit tests are often put in a nested `tests` module, using "
"`#[cfg(test)]` to conditionally compile them only when building tests."
msgstr ""
"Rust dan Cargo menyediakan unit test framework sederhana. Test ditandai "
"dengan `#[test]`. Unit test sering ditempatkan dalam module `tests` "
"bersarang, dengan `#[cfg(test)]` agar hanya dikompilasi ketika melakukan "
"build test."

#: src/testing/unit-tests.md
msgid "\"Hello World\""
msgstr "\"Hello World\""

#: src/testing/unit-tests.md
msgid "This lets you unit test private helpers."
msgstr "Dengan demikian, fungsi bantu private dapat diuji melalui unit test."

#: src/testing/unit-tests.md
msgid "The `#[cfg(test)]` attribute is only active when you run `cargo test`."
msgstr ""
"Atribut `#[cfg(test)]` hanya aktif ketika Anda menjalankan `cargo test`."

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid "Integration Tests"
msgstr "Integration Test"

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid "If you want to test your library as a client, use an integration test."
msgstr ""
"Jika ingin menguji library dari sisi pengguna, gunakan integration test."

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid "Create a `.rs` file under `tests/`:"
msgstr "Buat berkas `.rs` di dalam `tests/`:"

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid "// tests/my_library.rs\n"
msgstr "// tests/my_library.rs\n"

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid "These tests only have access to the public API of your crate."
msgstr "Test ini hanya dapat mengakses API publik crate Anda."

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid "Documentation Tests"
msgstr "Documentation Test"

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid "Rust has built-in support for documentation tests:"
msgstr "Rust memiliki dukungan bawaan untuk documentation test:"

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid ""
"/// Shortens a string to the given length.\n"
"///\n"
"/// ```\n"
"/// # use playground::shorten_string;\n"
"/// assert_eq!(shorten_string(\"Hello World\", 5), \"Hello\");\n"
"/// assert_eq!(shorten_string(\"Hello World\", 20), \"Hello World\");\n"
"/// ```\n"
msgstr ""
"/// Shortens a string to the given length.\n"
"///\n"
"/// ```\n"
"/// # use playground::shorten_string;\n"
"/// assert_eq!(shorten_string(\"Hello World\", 5), \"Hello\");\n"
"/// assert_eq!(shorten_string(\"Hello World\", 20), \"Hello World\");\n"
"/// ```\n"

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid "Code blocks in `///` comments are automatically seen as Rust code."
msgstr "Blok kode dalam komentar `///` otomatis dianggap sebagai kode Rust."

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid "The code will be compiled and executed as part of `cargo test`."
msgstr ""
"Kode tersebut dikompilasi dan dijalankan sebagai bagian dari `cargo test`."

#: src/testing/other.md
msgid ""
"Adding `#` in the code will hide it from the docs, but will still compile/run "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan `#` pada kode menyembunyikannya dari dokumentasi, tetapi kode "
"tetap dikompilasi/dijalankan."

