#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/common-traits.md
msgid ""
"Traits are one of the most potent tools in the Rust language. The language "
"and ecosystem expects you to use them, and so a big part of _predictability_ "
"is what traits are implemented for a type!"
