#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/raii/scope_guard.md
msgid ""
"This pattern is also useful when you don't control the cleanup strategy of "
"the resource object. In this example, `File::drop()` closes the file but does "
"not delete it."
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/raii/scope_guard.md
msgid ""
"The `scopeguard` crate also supports cleanup strategies via the [`Strategy`]"
"(https://docs.rs/scopeguard/latest/scopeguard/trait.Strategy.html) trait. You "
"can choose to run the guard on unwind only, or on success only, not just "
"always."
