#: src/idiomatic/from-oop-to-rust/why-no-inheritance.md
msgid ""
"Class inheritance implicitly allows types of different classes to be used "
"interchangeably, without being able to specify a concrete type or if a type "
"is identical to another."
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/from-oop-to-rust/why-no-inheritance.md
msgid ""
"For operations like equality or comparison this allows for comparison and "
"equality that throws an error or otherwise panics."
